<h2 id="obsolete-section-formally-smooth" class="tex-section"><span data-tag="07GD">115.6</span> Formally smooth ring maps</h2>

<p>
<article class="env-lemma" id="00TO">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/00TO">Lemma <span data-tag="00TO">115.6.1</span>.</a> Let $R$ be a ring. Let $S$ be a $R$-algebra. If $S$ is of finite presentation and formally smooth over $R$ then $S$ is smooth over $R$. </p>
</article> 
</p>
<article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      See Algebra, Proposition <a href="/tag/00TN" data-tag="00TN">10.138.13</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>
